<body>
<h1>Commit Review — Human-in-the-Loop</h1>
<p class="sub"><strong>Message:</strong> $GOAL &mdash; <strong>Version:</strong> $VERSION &mdash; <strong>Hash:</strong> $SHORT_HASH</p>

<div class="section">
  <h2><span class="letter">A</span> Staged Changes</h2>
  <div class="diff-box">$(git diff --cached --stat | head -30)</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <h2><span class="letter">B</span> 代码质量评估</h2>
  <div class="q">
    <p>1. 变更量是否合理？有没有不必要的修改？</p>
    <div class="opts" id="q1">
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q1" value="5"> 非常精简</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q1" value="4"> 合理</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q1" value="3"> 一般</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q1" value="2"> 偏多</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q1" value="1"> 过度修改</label>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="q">
    <p>2. 每个变更是否都能追溯到 commit message 的目标？</p>
    <div class="opts" id="q2">
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q2" value="5"> 全部可追溯</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q2" value="4"> 大部分可追溯</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q2" value="3"> 一半左右</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q2" value="2"> 部分无关</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q2" value="1"> 大量漂移</label>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="q">
    <p>3. 新增/删除的代码是否有注释或文档同步更新？</p>
    <div class="opts" id="q3">
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q3" value="5"> 文档完整</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q3" value="4"> 有同步更新</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q3" value="3"> 部分更新</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q3" value="2"> 缺失较多</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q3" value="1"> 未更新文档</label>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <h2><span class="letter">C</span> 流水线 & 可追溯性</h2>
  <div class="q">
    <p>4. 这次变更是否会破坏现有的流水线或 hook？</p>
    <div class="opts" id="q4">
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q4" value="5"> 无影响</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q4" value="4"> 极小影响</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q4" value="3"> 不确定</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q4" value="2"> 可能破坏</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q4" value="1"> 会破坏</label>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="q">
    <p>5. 这次变更的 trace 是否完整可回溯？</p>
    <div class="opts" id="q5">
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q5" value="5"> 完整可回溯</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q5" value="4"> 基本可回溯</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q5" value="3"> 部分可回溯</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q5" value="2"> 难以回溯</label>
      <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q5" value="1"> 无法回溯</label>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <h2><span class="letter">D</span> 开放反馈</h2>
  <div class="q">
    <p>6. 当前最应该改进的是什么？（可选）</p>
    <textarea id="feedback" placeholder="任何额外的观察、担忧或建议..."></textarea>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <h2><span class="letter">E</span> 最终决策</h2>
  <div class="verdict go" id="verdict-go">GO — commit will proceed</div>
  <div class="verdict nogo" id="verdict-nogo">NO-GO — commit will be blocked</div>
  <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--body);margin-bottom:12px;">完成以上评估后，选择是否允许本次 commit。</p>
  <div class="btn-row">
    <button class="btn btn-go" onclick="submit('go')">GO — 允许提交</button>
    <button class="btn btn-nogo" onclick="submit('nogo')">NO-GO — 阻止提交</button>
  </div>
  <div id="status"></div>
</div>

<script>
function collect() {
  var r = {qs:{}, feedback: document.getElementById('feedback').value};
  ['q1','q2','q3','q4','q5'].forEach(function(id) {
    var sel = document.querySelector('input[name="'+id+'"]:checked');
    if (sel) r.qs[id] = sel.value;
  });
  return r;
}
async function submit(d) {
  document.getElementById('status').textContent = 'Submitting...';
  var data = collect();
  data.decision = d;
  data.short_hash = '$SHORT_HASH';
  data.timestamp = new Date().toISOString();
  try {
    await fetch('http://127.0.0.1:8767/submit-feedback', {
      method: 'POST', headers: {'Content-Type': 'application/json'},
      body: JSON.stringify(data)
    });
    document.getElementById('verdict-' + d).style.display = 'block';
    document.querySelector('.btn-row').style.display = 'none';
    document.getElementById('status').textContent = d === 'go' ? 'GO — you may close this tab.' : 'NO-GO — commit blocked.';
  } catch(e) {
    document.getElementById('status').textContent = 'Error: archive server not reachable on port 8767.';
  }
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
